  "title": "Potato Casserole I",
  "description": "Turkey or ham leftovers can be added to this one dish meal made with frozen hash browns. The potatoes are combined with sour cream, onions, cheese, cream of mushroom and chicken soups and baked with a potato chip and bacon bit topping.",
